– **SOLUBILITY AND DISSOLUTION** (PARTICLE SIZE, PH OF THE INTESTINAL FLUID);  
– **LIPID‑WATER SOLUBILITY/LIPOPHILICITY** OF THE DRUG;  
– **SURFACE AREA OF THE INTESTINES** (LARGER AREA → GREATER ABSORPTION).

